(SUSHI GO! - Demo Rulebook \(Board Game Cafe\)) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(OVERVIEW) Tj T*
(A fast card drafting game over 3 rounds. Pick the best sushi dishes from the hand that) Tj T*
(passes around the table and score combinations.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(DEALING) Tj T*
(Deal 10 cards each with 2 players, 9 with 3 players, 8 with 4 players and 7 with 5) Tj T*
(players.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(A TURN) Tj T*
(Everyone picks one card at the same time and puts it face down. All picked cards are) Tj T*
(revealed together, then each player passes the rest of their hand to the left. The) Tj T*
(round ends when all cards are played.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(CHOPSTICKS) Tj T*
(On a later turn, a player with chopsticks in front of them may take 2 cards from the) Tj T*
(hand they hold and return the chopsticks to that hand.) Tj T*
ET
