(SCORING AT THE END OF EACH ROUND) Tj T*
(- Maki rolls: the most maki symbols score 6 points, the second most 3 points. Ties) Tj T*
(   split.) Tj T*
(- Tempura: 5 points for each pair.) Tj T*
(- Sashimi: 10 points for each set of 3.) Tj T*
(- Dumplings: 1, 3, 6, 10 or 15 points for 1, 2, 3, 4, 5 or more.) Tj T*
(- Nigiri: egg 1 point, salmon 2 points, squid 3 points.) Tj T*
(- Wasabi: triples the value of the next nigiri played on it.) Tj T*
(- Chopsticks: 0 points.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(PUDDINGS) Tj T*
(Puddings stay in front of you until the end of the game. The player with the most) Tj T*
(puddings scores 6 points and the player with the fewest loses 6 points. With 2) Tj T*
(players, nobody loses points.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(WINNER) Tj T*
(After 3 rounds the most points wins. On a tie, the most puddings wins.) Tj T*
ET
